{"name":"Junkrat","hex":"#998778","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[],"entries":[{"title":"Junkrat","blocks":[{"text":"Junkrat is the alias of Jamison Fawkes, a character who first appeared in the 2016 video game Overwatch, a Blizzard Entertainment–developed first-person hero shooter, and the resulting franchise. Junkrat is an insane man obsessed with explosives, living in an irradiated Australia. After finding a valuable secret, he becomes a target for various groups and forms a partnership with the character Roadhog. The two engage in a crime spree, but later come into conflict with the city Junkertown and its ruler, Junker Queen."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/e/e0/Overwatch-Junkrat.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Junkrat","wikidata":"Q56709667"}],"images":[],"sounds":{},"pictures":[{"title":"Grey Carpet from above","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3c/Grey_Carpet_from_above.jpg/500px-Grey_Carpet_from_above.jpg","ratio":1.3333333333333333,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Grey_Carpet_from_above.jpg","share":0.33625},{"title":"Eastern grey kangaroo (Macropus giganteus) Mount Annan composite of 6","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/46/Eastern_grey_kangaroo_%28Macropus_giganteus%29_Mount_Annan_composite_of_6.jpg/500px-Eastern_grey_kangaroo_%28Macropus_giganteus%29_Mount_Annan_composite_of_6.jpg","ratio":4.413151003782368,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Eastern_grey_kangaroo_(Macropus_giganteus)_Mount_Annan_composite_of_6.jpg","share":0.31625},{"title":"Grey rectangle","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0f/Grey_rectangle.jpg/500px-Grey_rectangle.jpg","ratio":0.75,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Grey_rectangle.jpg","share":0.238125},{"title":"Grey-breasted mountain toucan (Andigena hypoglauca) Caldas","image":"https:/